p.src:
We let $E_{\mathrm{rep}}$ denote reported engagement and $M_{\mathrm{rep}}$ denote reported monthly active users. The lecture’s bookkeeping logic is then captured by the decompositions $\begin{aligned}
E_{\mathrm{rep}} &= E_{\mathrm{auth}} + E_{\mathrm{bot}}, \\
M_{\mathrm{rep}} &= M_{\mathrm{auth}} + M_{\mathrm{bot}},\end{aligned}$ where the subscripts $\mathrm{auth}$ and $\mathrm{bot}$ distinguish authentic activity from bot-generated activity.

